- Integrate visualization (Matplotlib / Dash / Streamlit).  
- Add **time-series forecasting models** (ARIMA, Prophet, LSTM).  
- Deploy API endpoint for real-time AQI predictions.  
- Incorporate additional weather features for better accuracy.  

